<li><strong>Four campuses:</strong> SLAT admits to Symbiosis Law Schools in Pune, Noida, Hyderabad and Nagpur, across B.A. LL.B. (Hons.), B.B.A. LL.B. (Hons.), B.A. LL.B. and B.B.A. LL.B. programmes.</li>
